  "$comment": [
    "The tier map for tools/sync: ordered rules over upstream repo-relative paths, first match wins.",
    "Each rule has \"path\" (exact) or \"glob\" (\"*\" within a segment, \"**\" any number of segments) and a tier:",
    "1 vendored verbatim; 2 vendored with transforms.json; 3 rewritten for Avalonia and watched (the report lists PRs touching it);",
